            <td>$42</td>
            <td>$72</td>
            <td>$145</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="article-cta">
      <h3 class="article-cta__title">Book Your Tier</h3>
      <p class="article-cta__desc">Still not sure? Come in for a consultation. We'll put physical samples in your hands and help you decide with zero pressure.</p>
      <a href="/book" class="btn btn--gold">Book Your Weld</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Related ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section--butter section--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="related-articles">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Continue Reading</span>
      <div class="related-links">
        <a href="/learn/what-is-permanent-jewelry" class="related-link">What Is Permanent Jewelry?</a>
        <a href="/learn/aftercare" class="related-link">Aftercare Guide</a>
